<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Chameleon Skin</ansi> mutation

Your skin shifts colour and pattern to match your surroundings, making
you extraordinarily difficult to spot when still. The mutation comes
with a cost — your skin becomes thinner and more sensitive, leaving
you vulnerable to temperature extremes.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Skin
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greatly improved stealth — nearly invisible when standing still
  Slightly improved dodge — your shifting colours disrupt targeting

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced charisma — the constant rippling skin unnerves
  those around you
  Reduced natural armor — your thinner skin offers less protection

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Thick Hide, Bioluminescence

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
